        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-3704, Traditional Beaded Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Beaded Middle Hanging Pull has a traditional look that grants it a cozy feel. It is details like this that help transform a house into a home and keep it from looking too sterile and cold. This simple beaded pull is available with a 5 inch, an 8 inch, or a 12 inch center to center. Choose from the 6 available finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-3704 Simple Beaded Middle Hanging Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-3704:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 5-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-3705:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 8-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-3706:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR25_size.gif?v=1704354575\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
